HUGE, MAJOR, BIG TIME SPOILERS AHEAD!

I'm not kidding--your games may become too easy because of this

YOU HAVE BEEN WARNED





























I have found a great way to get all kinds of resistances, including: 
magic, fire, sleep, cold, shock, poison, and possibly even disintegration
resistance!  You only need two items:  a ring of polymorph, and a ring
of polymorph control.

Just keep polymorphing into all colors of dragons, and lay an egg of
each color.  Let the eggs hatch.  Kill your baby dragons and eat them.
(Real easy when you are a dragon yourself.)
 
Warnings: 
I am not sure if you lose luck or not by killing your pets.  So if you are
worried about that, make the baby dragons kill themselves with a ring of
conflict.  If you are worried about over-eating, use a tinning kit to can
each one first.  I'm not sure that there is such a thing as disintegration
resistance, but if there is, eating a baby black dragon should do the trick.

On a related note:
A blessed tinning kit is the first thing I wish for.  You will never again
have to worry about food (especially if you are into polymorphing items).

NetHack3.0 is NOT too hard.  You just have to think.  Be inventive!

And, by all means, correct me if I'm wrong.

If you want to know which dragons do what, read on

Color:     breathes:                    power gained by eating it:
__________________________________________________________________
black      disintegration (death) ray  ?disintegration resistance
grey      ?magic missile                magic resistance
white      blast of frost               cold resistance
red        fire                         fire resistance
orange     sleep ray                    sleep resistance
yellow    ?acid                        ?(maybe stone resistance??)
green     ?poison                       poison resistance
blue       lightning                    shock (lightning) resistance

"?" means that I am not sure--please correct me if you know

